      "line": 52,
      "priority": "P1",
      "recommendation": "Require and verify external archive, download and restoration evidence bound to this sealed manifest, including packaged-verifier identity and matching recomputation results. Otherwise retain PENDING_DELIVERY.",
      "trigger": "After an otherwise valid CPU8 run, supply a hashed external completion receipt containing the matching freeze, manifest and tool-binding hashes, valid times, and restoration_verified/tool_exit_verified=true, without performing remote restoration."
